      "parameters": {
        "content": "## GD·08 Ops executor (Boss 5 · D6b)\nA plain workflow, not the agent. Every 10 min: approved proposals → allow-list checked AGAIN in code → before-values saved → the change → result logged.\n- merge_companies: only if both companies really share the verified domain\n- bulk_update_property: before-values saved for undo\n- create_task\n- require_field / score_weight: not automatable on the free plan → Tolu/Nodo told to make it by hand, marked manual\n\n**Credentials:** HubSpot App Token (write scopes), Postgres, Telegram. **Replace:** YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID, YOUR_HUBSPOT_OWNER_ID.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 440
      },
